  "description": "A sweet revenge brought about by a misunderstanding begins! \n\nYu-Na, who has failed to register for classes and entered an unfamiliar classroom, bumps into Jung-Woo, who looks exactly like her best friend Ji-Soo's playboy ex-boyfriend, and they kiss by an unexpected accident. Jung-Woo misunderstands Yu-Na's actions due to his past experiences(?) and says, \"I'll date you,\" so Yu-Na plans a grand revenge of 'seducing and dumping'...\n\n(Source: Peanutoon, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes 15 side story chapters.*",
